# General Rules for the Brain MCP Server and Brain API and Database

For the Python version of the MCP server, keep all relevant files in the 'python/' folder and sub-folders. This includes the doc/ and /memory_bank folders.

## Local Database Use

In Windows, the default location for The Brain database and files is `%USERPROFILE%\Brains`

The Brain app needs to be running and the brain open in the app to sync the databases and files with the cloud.

You can check to see if anything recent has changed on the cloud.

## The Brain version 15

The Brain 15 now allows the user to not sync attachments to the local computer, so attachments may not be available unless this option is disabled.
